    "source_client": "D2 passes through only repository_cleanup_unverified from an HTTPError body at most 16 KiB. All other HTTPError categories, invalid/oversize/read/close failures become source_discovery_failed; other request failures become source_service_unavailable. Other SourceError categories remain HTTP-boundary diagnostics, not current node output.",
    "operation_client": "Every request/HTTP/parse failure becomes skill_operation_unavailable; handler's skill_operation_refused is not current node output.",
    "issue_client": "Only ERROR_CODES survive response admission; unlisted HTTP categories become github_issue_unavailable or issue_write_unknown when a write may have been dispatched.",
    "pr_client": "Only ERROR_CODES survive response admission; unlisted HTTP categories become github_pr_unavailable or pr_write_unknown when a write may have been dispatched."
